WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a wide-legged squat, thread the arms behind the knees toward the back.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Plant the hands flat, fingers spread, shoulder-width apart.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Shift weight into the hands and begin to straighten the legs out to the sides.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Press the thighs high onto the upper arms as the hips lift.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Straighten the legs as much as available, gaze forward, then lower with control.
